[[Category:Quests]]

I wanted to create a page for people that wanted to quest, alone or with a group and sorted by level instead of by name. This list focuses more on gear other than any other normal quest. This guide is for the following people.
* New Players
* Players that don't have the money to buy gear.
* Players that like to simply quest.

